    "assignedEditorId": null,
    "assignedEditorName": null,
    "status": "Published",
    "summary": "How to make money in one day. Class by Mr Aditya",
    "content": "<p>Most of the people doesn't know how to make money but the wait is over we have Mr Aditya who can teach us how to make money in one day!</p><p>There are <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Economics_of_car_use\" title=\"Economics of car use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">costs and benefits to car use</a>. The costs to the individual include acquiring the vehicle, repairs and maintenance, fuel, driving time, parking fees, taxes, and insurance.<sup><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Car#cite_note-racv-12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[12]</a></sup> Personal benefits include on-demand transportation, mobility, independence, and convenience.<sup><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Car#cite_note-setright-13\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[13]</a></sup> Societal benefits include economic benefits, such as job and wealth creation from the automotive industry, and societal wellbeing from leisure and travel opportunities. Traffic collisions are the largest cause of injury-related deaths worldwide.<sup><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Car#cite_note-who_stats-14\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[14]</a></sup> As of 2024, cars produce 10% of global carbon dioxide emissions, contributing to climate change. Other environmental impacts include the resources used to produce and dispose of them and procure their fuel, air pollution from exhaust and particles released by brakes and contact between tyres and the road, and noise and light pollution. Widespread car use results in road congestion and promotes urban sprawl, leading to higher infrastructure costs, habitat destruction, limited mobility for those who cannot drive (including children, disabled people, and the elderly), social isolation, and sedentary lifestyles that worsen health outcomes.</p>",
    "imageUrl": "/videos/make-money-poster.jpg",
    "coverMediaType": "video",
    "videoUrl": "/videos/make-money-cover.mp4",
